"Lax1dude","glsl/deferred/shader_pack_icon.png","Guns Mod","1.3.7","A new and exciting weapon mod with a unique vision. Adding nine weapons, all can be highly customised to create your own unique variant. Using attachments and enchantments, you can increase the stats of a weapon to create an even more powerful version. Dyes can be used to change the colour of any weapon and attachment. This mod also adds grenades and stun grenades!","MrCrayfish","MIT","eaglerz/mods/guns.png","ViaVersion Items","v2.0","A mod that adds items from newer versions of Minecraft to older versions, allowing you to experience content from future updates right now! This mod is a client-side addon for ViaVersion and requires it to function. Adding new Items, Blocks, and more from newer versions of Minecraft to older versions. Note: This mod is purely cosmetic and does not add any new mechanics or features from the newer versions.",
